WEBVTT

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:07.760
The European Health Data Space is
already in force and has dates.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:13.340
By March two thousand twenty-seven, each country
must designate its access bodies.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:18.340
In March two thousand twenty-nine, most of
the rules on secondary use apply,

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:23.940
and in two thousand thirty-one medical images
arrive, such as dental X-rays.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.980
Most practices are micro-businesses
and are exempt by default:

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.920
to take part they need an
aggregated channel,

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.280
through chains, associations or insurers.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.840
Each Member State is preparing
its access body:

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:41.060
some have a draft law, others a
candidate agency.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.600
None had been formally designated by
November two thousand twenty-six.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:49.450
Whoever arrives connected will be
the natural partner.
